Package: io.github.jangcuber.snapclient
Name: Snapclient (iPhone Spatial Audio)
Version: 0.35.0~sa16
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: jangcuber (github.com/jangcuber)
Author: Johannes Pohl (Snapcast), iOS port for iPhone Spatial Audio
Section: Multimedia
Description: Snapcast client for jailbroken iOS (Dopamine, rootless).
 Plays a Snapcast stream through the built-in speaker. Adds --channel to
 play one source channel on both speakers. GPL-3.0 (Snapcast).
